1
00:00:39,667 --> 00:00:45,728
=My Loong=

2
00:00:45,971 --> 00:00:48,704
=Episode 18=

3
00:00:49,843 --> 00:00:50,880
(Medical Notes)

4
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:51,960
(To Madam Jiang)

5
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:54,719
These are the medical notes
Madam kept during her lifetime?

6
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:56,960
Lately, I've been sorting through

7
00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:59,039
the Yue family's letters
and account books.

8
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:01,079
With Wangshu's betrothal,

9
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:03,320
I wanted to look
for Mother's old belongings.

10
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:06,239
Then I saw a few pages missing.

11
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,000
Uncle Fu,

12
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:10,200
Mother was never careless
with her medical records.

13
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,159
Even if she made revisions,

14
00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:13,719
she wouldn't just rip them out.

15
00:01:15,560 --> 00:01:17,000
Can you recall anything about it?

16
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:19,640
Well,

17
00:01:20,079 --> 00:01:22,879
nothing comes to mind right now.

18
00:01:23,599 --> 00:01:24,840
Tearing medical record pages

19
00:01:25,079 --> 00:01:26,920
certainly wasn't how Madam

20
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:28,680
did things.

21
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:30,480
If someone else tore them out,

22
00:01:32,239 --> 00:01:34,439
there must have been something
they wanted hidden.

23
00:01:34,719 --> 00:01:36,359
Then why not take the whole book?

24
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:39,159
Perhaps it wasn't easy to take,

25
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:40,799
so it was done in haste?

26
00:01:43,239 --> 00:01:45,200
If Madam Jiang did it,

27
00:01:45,480 --> 00:01:46,200
she could have

28
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:47,359
easily destroyed them later.

29
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:50,319
Uncle Fu,

30
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:52,200
please help me look

31
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:54,599
for any corroborating records
in the manor.

32
00:01:54,959 --> 00:01:55,640
Yes, My Lady.

33
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:57,376
By the way,

34
00:01:58,079 --> 00:01:59,599
Wangshu is busy with her wedding,

35
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:01,359
so don't mention this to her yet.

36
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:04,760
Madam can rest in peace

37
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:06,079
in the afterlife.

38
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:07,719
It seems

39
00:02:08,199 --> 00:02:09,840
you're truly all grown up, Lady Xingyao.

40
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:12,639
To let Lady Wangshu marry in peace,

41
00:02:12,639 --> 00:02:15,960
you shoulder
all the family matters alone

42
00:02:16,479 --> 00:02:18,199
and even deal with Master Lizhi's elder,

43
00:02:18,199 --> 00:02:20,400
who knows nothing of mortal customs.

44
00:02:20,759 --> 00:02:21,919
It must be hard on you.

45
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:23,719
I wonder if it's because

46
00:02:23,719 --> 00:02:26,039
I scolded him
for ignoring Wangshu's wishes.

47
00:02:27,080 --> 00:02:27,840
Now

48
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:31,240
he insists on following
the most tedious mortal rules,

49
00:02:31,439 --> 00:02:33,759
sending his elder
to consult me every day.

50
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:36,000
I suspect

51
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:37,280
he's using this as an excuse

52
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:38,479
to retaliate for my meddling.

53
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:39,680
Lady Xingyao,

54
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:41,639
don't overwork yourself.

55
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:44,039
Lady Wangshu has found a good match.

56
00:02:44,159 --> 00:02:44,759
I'm truly

57
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:46,639
happy for her.

58
00:02:47,199 --> 00:02:48,080
If only

59
00:02:48,439 --> 00:02:50,639
General and Madam were still here

60
00:02:50,879 --> 00:02:52,360
to support you,

61
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,960
you wouldn't have to work this hard.

62
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:56,240
Speaking of which,

63
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,400
the imperial censor

64
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,520
who was bustling

65
00:02:58,520 --> 00:03:00,680
around the manor just days ago

66
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:01,439
has oddly

67
00:03:02,039 --> 00:03:03,879
stopped showing up at all lately.

68
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:06,759
It seems

69
00:03:06,759 --> 00:03:08,080
planning a wedding

70
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:10,479
is a bigger headache than solving cases.

71
00:03:10,599 --> 00:03:11,264
Indeed.

72
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:15,919
Look at them!

73
00:03:21,088 --> 00:03:21,632
Look!

74
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,400
Those chests are piled so high.

75
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,319
Such a grand display.

76
00:03:25,319 --> 00:03:26,879
Are they heading
to the mountain cottage?

77
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:27,800
You bet!

78
00:03:28,199 --> 00:03:29,280
The one leading the way

79
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:30,759
is the imperial censor.

80
00:03:31,039 --> 00:03:32,120
The honorable judge

81
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:33,479
who ruled in Lady Wangshu's favor

82
00:03:33,479 --> 00:03:35,000
against the Guardian General's Manor.

83
00:03:35,199 --> 00:03:36,599
I heard Lady Wangshu is setting

84
00:03:36,599 --> 00:03:37,639
her wedding date.

85
00:03:37,919 --> 00:03:39,879
Could the censor
be delivering wedding gifts?

86
00:03:40,719 --> 00:03:41,879
The censor delivering gifts?

87
00:03:41,879 --> 00:03:42,400
Look.

88
00:03:43,199 --> 00:03:44,120
Look at this scale.

89
00:03:44,479 --> 00:03:46,560
How could a censor
muster such a grand display?

90
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:48,800
Could it be that he's on behalf

91
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:49,719
of His Majesty?

92
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:51,599
- Let's go see!
- Let's go!

93
00:03:51,599 --> 00:03:52,224
Come on.

94
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:55,439
What's going on?

95
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:18,879
An imperial edict has arrived.

96
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:21,879
No.

97
00:04:23,199 --> 00:04:24,720
This hour won't do.

98
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:26,000
The timing is inauspicious.

99
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:29,319
The Loong Lord shouldn't
fuss over such things.

100
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:30,360
No.

101
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:31,639
He said

102
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,160
if we follow mortal rules,

103
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:35,600
we must see them through to the end.

104
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:42,000
(If these two arrange the wedding,)

105
00:04:42,319 --> 00:04:43,959
(it'll turn into a complete joke.)

106
00:04:44,839 --> 00:04:45,759
(This is a chance.)

107
00:04:46,839 --> 00:04:48,399
I come by His Majesty's decree

108
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:49,480
to proclaim the edict.

109
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:57,279
Why kneel to him?

110
00:04:57,399 --> 00:04:57,984
Stand up.

111
00:04:59,399 --> 00:05:00,120
By imperial decree,

112
00:05:00,399 --> 00:05:01,480
this is a heavenly match,

113
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,439
blessed by the throne.

114
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:04,120
All formalities are waived today.

115
00:05:04,319 --> 00:05:05,399
Rise and receive the edict.

116
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,160
Please rise.

117
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:07,360
Stand up.

118
00:05:11,700 --> 00:05:13,199
(By Heaven's decree,
the Emperor proclaims)

119
00:05:13,199 --> 00:05:14,000
By Heaven's decree,

120
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:15,240
the Emperor proclaims:

121
00:05:15,399 --> 00:05:16,560
General Zhenbei's Manor,

122
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:18,920
driven by wild ambitions,
fabricated divine will

123
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:19,959
and forged imperial edicts.

124
00:05:20,439 --> 00:05:21,879
Under my name,

125
00:05:21,879 --> 00:05:22,879
they cast Yue Wangshu,

126
00:05:22,879 --> 00:05:24,959
descendant of loyal subjects,
into the Loong Abyss,

127
00:05:24,959 --> 00:05:26,399
bringing her to the brink of death.

128
00:05:26,759 --> 00:05:27,600
The human sacrifice

129
00:05:27,600 --> 00:05:28,680
was utterly preposterous,

130
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:29,800
neither my intention

131
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:30,920
nor Heaven's will.

132
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:33,079
Yue Wangshu, born of a line of generals,

133
00:05:33,079 --> 00:05:34,000
is firm and unyielding.

134
00:05:34,199 --> 00:05:35,160
Though trapped in peril,

135
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:36,399
her resolve never wavered.

136
00:05:36,399 --> 00:05:39,040
General's Manor previously
named her Princess Hexi

137
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:40,160
under a forged decree.

138
00:05:40,759 --> 00:05:42,800
Now that she has found a worthy match,

139
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:45,399
I confer upon her
the title of Princess Hexi

140
00:05:45,399 --> 00:05:46,680
in praise of her fortitude.

141
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:47,240
Let me see.

142
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:50,639
Princess Hexi's wedding
shall observe imperial protocol,

143
00:05:50,759 --> 00:05:52,839
with all expenses
borne by the imperial court.

144
00:05:53,079 --> 00:05:55,560
Officials from the Ministry of Rites
shall assist

145
00:05:55,879 --> 00:05:56,879
to show imperial favor.

146
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:58,120
Thus decreed.

147
00:06:08,439 --> 00:06:10,000
Princess Hexi, receive the edict.

148
00:06:13,839 --> 00:06:14,879
I thank His Majesty.

149
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:18,040
Granting me the title of princess

150
00:06:18,199 --> 00:06:19,399
is already an immense honor.

151
00:06:19,399 --> 00:06:22,160
Yet evildoers still plague this world,

152
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:23,199
and disasters persist.

153
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:24,800
I humbly ask

154
00:06:25,120 --> 00:06:27,000
to sell these gifts and estates

155
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,839
to fund disaster relief.

156
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:31,480
If this can bring peace to the people,

157
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:33,360
it will be the greatest blessing

158
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:34,639
for our marriage.

159
00:06:35,279 --> 00:06:36,160
Your benevolence

160
00:06:36,279 --> 00:06:37,839
will surely delight His Majesty.

161
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:43,759
Wangshu,

162
00:06:44,199 --> 00:06:45,160
look what I found you.

163
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:46,879
It's beautiful.

164
00:06:47,199 --> 00:06:48,000
Let me put it on you.

165
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:52,000
This is meant to be donated.

166
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:55,079
It looks lovely on you.

167
00:07:07,839 --> 00:07:08,920
(Making me a princess)

168
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,000
(is actually)

169
00:07:10,879 --> 00:07:12,439
(a way to win Lizhi over.)

170
00:07:12,879 --> 00:07:13,959
(Turning down the rewards)

171
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:16,439
(should get the message across.)

172
00:07:28,832 --> 00:07:33,407
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

173
00:07:34,182 --> 00:07:38,679
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

174
00:07:41,918 --> 00:07:47,040
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

175
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:50,379
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

176
00:07:50,379 --> 00:07:51,743
♪Refusing to forget♪

177
00:07:55,409 --> 00:08:00,186
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

178
00:08:00,737 --> 00:08:02,527
♪He cannot learn them♪

179
00:08:02,527 --> 00:08:05,662
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

180
00:08:08,814 --> 00:08:11,138
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

181
00:08:11,138 --> 00:08:13,536
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

182
00:08:14,079 --> 00:08:16,743
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

183
00:08:16,743 --> 00:08:18,501
♪Their days ahead are long♪

184
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:31,519
What?

185
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:34,320
Are you jealous, My Lord?

186
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:38,600
I accepted the title

187
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:41,000
not out of gratitude to Master Wei Xun.

188
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:41,840
Then why?

189
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:43,759
Because Elder Lanyuan

190
00:08:43,759 --> 00:08:44,600
and Xingyao

191
00:08:44,919 --> 00:08:46,720
were already pulling their hair out

192
00:08:47,039 --> 00:08:48,519
over the wedding etiquette.

193
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:49,840
Now His Majesty

194
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:51,000
has decreed the marriage.

195
00:08:51,159 --> 00:08:53,000
So it will follow imperial protocol,

196
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:54,519
handled by officials,

197
00:08:55,039 --> 00:08:56,120
sparing everyone trouble.

198
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:01,080
Did you have Elder Lanyuan
torment Xingyao

199
00:09:01,799 --> 00:09:03,639
just to get back at her
for scolding you?

200
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:11,399
I'm not mortal.

201
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:13,639
Why would I hold petty grudges?

202
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:16,440
It might be troublesome.

203
00:09:16,840 --> 00:09:17,639
But before,

204
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:19,600
you followed all my rules.

205
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:21,200
From now on,

206
00:09:21,399 --> 00:09:22,320
I'll follow yours.

207
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:26,000
So,

208
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:27,320
do you really

209
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:29,840
plan to stay?

210
00:09:32,519 --> 00:09:33,200
But

211
00:09:33,919 --> 00:09:35,240
if you stay in the mortal realm,

212
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:37,000
what about your Li Fire?

213
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:38,519
I have you, don't I?

214
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:44,600
Still, by mortal rules,

215
00:09:44,679 --> 00:09:45,519
living together

216
00:09:45,759 --> 00:09:47,320
like this before getting married

217
00:09:48,200 --> 00:09:50,080
makes us what your storybooks call

218
00:09:50,679 --> 00:09:51,720
scandalous lovers.

219
00:09:53,919 --> 00:09:54,480
Does it?

220
00:09:56,639 --> 00:09:57,759
Even after the betrothal?

221
00:10:01,879 --> 00:10:02,399
In that case,

222
00:10:03,759 --> 00:10:05,080
we'll just have to live apart.

223
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:08,120
Th-That's not what I meant.

224
00:10:12,399 --> 00:10:13,279
You're teasing me.

225
00:10:13,759 --> 00:10:15,000
Since when did you know

226
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:15,759
mortal rules so well?

227
00:10:16,919 --> 00:10:18,200
While I was away,

228
00:10:18,799 --> 00:10:19,600
I was watching you.

229
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:23,320
I know Xingyao matters most to you.

230
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:25,120
Whatever she values,

231
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:26,519
I value too.

232
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:39,120
So

233
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:41,600
that ugly bird

234
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:43,120
eavesdropping by our door earlier

235
00:10:44,279 --> 00:10:45,639
was you, wasn't it?

236
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:48,399
That was a wisp of my soul.

237
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:49,600
A wisp of your soul?

238
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:51,120
Besides,

239
00:10:51,879 --> 00:10:53,159
that bird wasn't ugly.

240
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:54,919
Was it?

241
00:10:57,399 --> 00:10:59,240
Well, since your power is so great...

242
00:10:59,799 --> 00:11:00,679
My hair is wet.

243
00:11:00,759 --> 00:11:01,639
Dry it for me.

244
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,480
Such a trivial thing?

245
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:06,799
It's not trivial at all.

246
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:08,679
Drying hair is a huge hassle.

247
00:11:09,399 --> 00:11:10,200
I often wish

248
00:11:10,559 --> 00:11:11,919
it would just dry on its own.

249
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:14,600
Let me.

250
00:11:22,399 --> 00:11:24,120
See? Delicate work like this

251
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:25,120
takes real skill.

252
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,039
Let me try again.

253
00:11:37,639 --> 00:11:39,320
When Mother was still alive,

254
00:11:39,720 --> 00:11:41,120
she loved combing my hair.

255
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:43,080
It's a pity

256
00:11:43,399 --> 00:11:44,399
she can't see you

257
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:46,360
or me.

258
00:11:48,039 --> 00:11:49,399
I've finally found someone

259
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:51,720
to dry my hair for me.

260
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:54,279
From now on,

261
00:11:55,559 --> 00:11:56,679
I'll always dry it for you.

262
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:08,240
Cheers!

263
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:13,320
Chen Qingxuan

264
00:12:13,879 --> 00:12:15,600
didn't hold back at all during practice.

265
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:16,720
Look at my left arm.

266
00:12:16,919 --> 00:12:17,600
And my right.

267
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:19,279
It's longer than the left,

268
00:12:20,039 --> 00:12:21,519
all from sparring with him.

269
00:12:21,519 --> 00:12:22,799
That's nothing.

270
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:23,919
Look at me.

271
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:24,799
Look right here.

272
00:12:25,240 --> 00:12:26,159
Look.

273
00:12:27,399 --> 00:12:28,360
In the middle,

274
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:29,200
isn't a part missing?

275
00:12:30,799 --> 00:12:31,639
When we were young,

276
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:34,639
Wangshu would yank my hair
whenever she lost an argument.

277
00:12:35,240 --> 00:12:36,399
Do you have it worse than me?

278
00:12:36,639 --> 00:12:39,519
Balding at such a young age.

279
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:44,240
It's truly tragic.

280
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:46,159
- But now she
- But now he

281
00:12:46,159 --> 00:12:46,879
- can't beat me.
- can't beat me.

282
00:12:48,399 --> 00:12:49,240
- You're bluffing.
- You're bluffing.

283
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:05,200
What's wrong?

284
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:06,080
I...

285
00:13:06,600 --> 00:13:07,399
Your stomach hurts?

286
00:13:10,039 --> 00:13:11,919
You can't even beat me.

287
00:13:12,120 --> 00:13:13,480
You say you can beat Chen Qingxuan?

288
00:13:13,879 --> 00:13:14,799
You tricked me?

289
00:13:14,799 --> 00:13:15,480
So what if I did?

290
00:13:23,639 --> 00:13:24,279
Still,

291
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:26,600
be more careful from now on.

292
00:13:27,639 --> 00:13:28,840
If you're ever in danger,

293
00:13:29,200 --> 00:13:30,000
call for me.

294
00:13:30,679 --> 00:13:31,240
I got you.

295
00:13:37,440 --> 00:13:40,200
By the time you show up,

296
00:13:41,559 --> 00:13:43,320
it'll probably be dark.

297
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:45,840
Then I can move in here.

298
00:13:47,320 --> 00:13:48,399
I'll be your guard.

299
00:13:49,399 --> 00:13:50,480
Even a woodshed will do.

300
00:13:54,399 --> 00:13:57,440
You're truly devoted to Master Lizhi.

301
00:13:58,519 --> 00:14:01,000
You'd even sleep in a woodshed for him.

302
00:14:02,480 --> 00:14:03,279
I'm doing that

303
00:14:03,279 --> 00:14:04,120
not just for...

304
00:14:09,248 --> 00:14:14,208
♪Drowned in love and hate,
we torment each other♪

305
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:17,919
Xingyao,

306
00:14:21,039 --> 00:14:21,919
I'm doing all this

307
00:14:23,240 --> 00:14:24,360
not just for him.

308
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:26,656
What about you?

309
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:27,799
About what

310
00:14:28,320 --> 00:14:29,399
you've done lately,

311
00:14:30,919 --> 00:14:32,879
apart from seeking justice for yourself,

312
00:14:32,879 --> 00:14:34,039
is any part of it

313
00:14:35,679 --> 00:14:36,480
for the person

314
00:14:38,039 --> 00:14:38,720
in front of you?

315
00:14:39,776 --> 00:14:43,808
♪Love grows in turmoil,
adrift and wandering♪

316
00:14:45,039 --> 00:14:46,000
Lady Xingyao.

317
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:48,519
Lady Xingyao.

318
00:15:01,600 --> 00:15:02,399
Are you sure?

319
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:03,960
Yes, Lady Xingyao.

320
00:15:04,679 --> 00:15:06,360
I remember during those days,

321
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:08,399
Madam was summoned into the palace.

322
00:15:08,840 --> 00:15:10,320
And it was during that exact time

323
00:15:10,519 --> 00:15:12,399
that the late Emperor passed away.

324
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:14,000
Lady Xingyao,

325
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:15,919
did Madam discover something?

326
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:18,000
If that's true,

327
00:15:18,440 --> 00:15:20,039
then the deaths of Madam and General...

328
00:15:20,039 --> 00:15:21,000
Are suspicious.

329
00:15:22,399 --> 00:15:24,120
Why else would those pages be torn out?

330
00:15:24,919 --> 00:15:26,320
Was it Madam Jiang?

331
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:29,639
No.

332
00:15:30,519 --> 00:15:31,840
She probably doesn't even

333
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:33,559
know the medical notes exist.

334
00:15:34,320 --> 00:15:36,200
Otherwise, with our parents gone so long

335
00:15:36,799 --> 00:15:38,399
and no one for us to rely on,

336
00:15:39,279 --> 00:15:40,960
she'd have time to destroy the evidence.

337
00:15:43,279 --> 00:15:44,200
Come to think of it,

338
00:15:44,639 --> 00:15:45,960
finding the medical notes

339
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:47,279
and tearing the pages

340
00:15:47,399 --> 00:15:48,799
both happened recently.

341
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:51,399
With the imperial censor

342
00:15:53,480 --> 00:15:54,639
protecting us lately,

343
00:15:55,039 --> 00:15:56,559
she must have grown anxious

344
00:15:56,559 --> 00:15:57,279
but couldn't act.

345
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:01,519
Besides me, the only people
who had access to the evidence recently

346
00:16:02,039 --> 00:16:03,679
were the imperial censor and...

347
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:08,639
Prefect Zhang Fan.

348
00:16:12,179 --> 00:16:16,754
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

349
00:16:17,529 --> 00:16:22,026
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

350
00:16:25,265 --> 00:16:30,387
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

351
00:16:30,387 --> 00:16:33,726
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

352
00:16:33,726 --> 00:16:35,090
♪Refusing to forget♪

353
00:16:38,756 --> 00:16:43,533
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

354
00:16:44,084 --> 00:16:45,874
♪He cannot learn them♪

355
00:16:45,874 --> 00:16:49,009
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

356
00:16:52,161 --> 00:16:54,485
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

357
00:16:54,485 --> 00:16:56,848
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

358
00:16:57,426 --> 00:17:00,090
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

359
00:17:00,090 --> 00:17:01,848
♪Their days ahead are long♪
